        }
      },
      {
        "page": 3,
        "total_pages": 3,
        "content": [
          "PRESENT PERFECT vs PRETERITE:",
          "",
          "He comido hoy. (I have eaten today.)     Press 1",
          "= connected to now, still relevant",
          "",
          "Comí ayer. (I ate yesterday.)            Press 2",
          "= done, finished, in the past",
          "",
          "PLUPERFECT = había + participle",
          "What had happened before something else:",
          "",
          "Ya había comido cuando llegaste.         Press 3",
          "(I had eaten when you arrived.)",
          "",
          "Congratulations — you now know the main",
